[gd_scene load_steps=2 format=3]

; Where residents work, sit and idle. Spots that share an Area form one work area; From and To are the
; town tiers at which the spot exists. A spot with a Use stands just clear of the prop that use names,
; facing it (village_life checks reach and facing). Seats sit on their log's center line.

